    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent London graphic design studio founded 2003 by Tim Beard (ex-North Design), Jonathon Jeffrey (ex-Farrow Design) and Mason Wells (ex-North Design). Currently estimated at ~6-10 people per LinkedIn (2-10 bracket) and a 2022 Wallpaper article citing six people in-house; earlier 2013 interviews mentioned eight core staff. AGI members since 2011, D&AD award winners. Operates as a full-spectrum graphic design consultancy: identity systems, print, publishing, packaging, type design, exhibition and spatial design, web/UX and naming/brand strategy, serving clients from Adidas and Nike to V&A and Design Museum. Autonomy 4: three founding directors with 20+ years running an independent studio, no parent network, set their own creative direction; client-service model keeps it below 5. IG context shot rate-limited during capture; rejected in manifest and queued to ig-queue.json for a logged-in ig.py grab.",
